THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND SIMULATED INTEGRATIONS

Backend
- FastAPI (MIT), Starlette (BSD-3-Clause), Pydantic (MIT), Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause).
- SQLAlchemy (MIT), psycopg2-binary (LGPL-3.0; binary dependencies have their own notices).
- Python standard library (PSF-2.0).

Frontend
- React / React DOM (MIT), TypeScript (Apache-2.0), Vite (MIT).
- Tailwind CSS (MIT), PostCSS (MIT), Autoprefixer (MIT).
