Infrastructure and tests
- PostgreSQL (PostgreSQL License), official postgres Docker image.
- Node.js and Python official Docker images; image licenses/notices remain in their respective images.
- pytest (MIT), HTTPX (BSD-3-Clause).

Data, models and external services
- No external datasets, paid APIs, proprietary models or LLMs are used.
- Product names, rates, limits, scores, companies, phone numbers and applications are synthetic demo data, not real Alfa-Bank offers or credit decisions.
- EGRUL/EGRIP, FNS-like registry lookup and credit bureau responses are deterministic local mocks in app/services.py.
- Login confirmation, document confirmation, contract signing and money issuance are local simulations.
- No SMS, email, messenger, payment or government-service calls are made.

This file is a component overview, not a replacement for license texts distributed inside dependencies and container images.
